{
  "id": 430704076,
  "iid": 22220,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "Register tap listeners within epan_init()",
  "description": "Move register_all_tap_listeners() into epan_init().  This simplifies the application layer, but also requires the list of tap listeners to be passed into epan_init as part of the epan_app_data_t.\nAll applications currently using epan_app_data_t were changed to ensure all members are initialized to 0/NULL in the case of future expansion.\n\nThis also fixes a crash when loading the \"Packet Length\" statistics as that tap contained a UAT, that was not loading its data because of the changes from d024a07477b7055991cab45bfd8d8d81963ef957, which loaded UAT data before tap listeners were registered (so it missed the \"stat tree\" tap listener UAT)",
  "state": "merged",
  "created_at": "2025-11-07T16:55:39.203Z",
  "updated_at": "2025-11-16T22:05:47.537Z",
