      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 2875486763,
          "type": null,
          "body": "Yes, I think this is a very logical improvement. I think we can worry about codecs later. (There are some codecs that maybe should have preferences that don't, like AMR, but I doubt any need UATs.)",
